Our company is a fast-growing international company.
Having been stable and successful for a long period we are working in close cooperation with a number of research
and investment organizations all over Europe.
We are looking for Regional Financial Representatives to work with our company.

Basically, it's a part-time job concerning certain tasks which will be assigned to you considering your previous experience and knowledge.
